Chinese leaker Ice Universe has <a href="https://weibo.com/5673255066/QBzya5nAP">shared</a> an image showing four camera plateau protection plates with finishes that appear to match the latest color rumors for Apple's iPhone 18 Pro models.<br/>
<br/>
